  "buyers_guide": [
    {
      "q": "Floodlight camera or regular outdoor camera?",
      "a": "A floodlight camera adds bright motion-activated lights, which light up a driveway or backyard and give color night video. It usually replaces an existing outdoor light fixture, so it's hardwired."
    },
    {
      "q": "Do floodlight cameras need wiring?",
      "a": "Most mount on a junction box in place of an existing light. Some plug into an outdoor outlet, and a few run on batteries and solar panels, with dimmer lights."
    },
    {
      "q": "Do I need a subscription?",
      "a": "It depends on the brand. Ring and Arlo keep recorded video behind a plan; eufy, Reolink, and some others record to local storage for free. Each listing's fee notes are in its pros and cons."
    }
  ]
}
